@startuml collab-sequence
title Édition concurrente — Channels + WebSocket + CRDT (Yjs)

actor "Alice" as A
actor "Bruno" as B
participant "Front A\n(Y.Doc + WS)" as FA
participant "Front B\n(Y.Doc + WS)" as FB
participant "REST API" as REST
participant "Consumer\nAnnotationRoom" as C
database "Redis\n(channel layer)" as R
database "Postgres" as DB

== Connexion ==
A -> REST : GET /annotations/{id}/collab-ticket (JWT)
REST --> A : ticket signé court
A -> C : WS connect ?ticket
C -> C : vérifie ticket + membership
C -> R : join group annotation.{id}
C -> DB : ActivityEvent(collab.join)
C --> FA : awareness (participants, couleurs)

B -> REST : GET collab-ticket
B -> C : WS connect ?ticket
C -> R : join group
C --> FB : awareness (Alice présente)
C --> FA : awareness (Bruno présent)

== Édition concurrente ==
A -> FA : re-thème clause @12 = TERMINATION
FA -> C : Yjs update (binaire) + op_id
C -> R : broadcast group
R --> FB : Yjs update
FB -> FB : merge CRDT (clause @12)
B -> FB : édite certitude clause @30
FB -> C : Yjs update
C -> R : broadcast
R --> FA : merge (clause @30)

== Persistance & audit ==
C -> C : debounce 2-5 s
C -> DB : snapshot Y.Doc + ActivityEvent(clause.retheme, set_certainty)

== Soumission ==
A -> REST : POST versions {name, description, kind:soumission}
REST -> DB : AnnotationVersion(snapshot, stats) + ActivityEvent(version.submit)
REST --> A : version créée
@enduml
